{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20904","headline":"湖中曲 · 李贺","name":"湖中曲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"长眉越沙采兰若，桂叶水葓春漠漠。\n横船醉眠白昼闲，渡口梅风歌扇薄。\n燕钗玉股照青渠，越王娇郎小字书。\n蜀纸封巾报云鬓，晚漏壶中水淋尽。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20904.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20904","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}